real villain of chapter two sloane was  first heard when sending an io agent  onto the island to protect the zero  point  when that failed she came to the island  herself to lead the fight against the  alien invasion sloan has actually tried  to kill us in the past which isn't very  nice first recruiting us to make a  daring attack on the mothership and then  refusing to bring us back home leaving  us to go kaboom luckily we survived our  fall from the edge of space and sloan  had already continued with her plan  opening the redacted bunker for some  reason away from the island sloan has  made an alliance with lex luthor and the  batman who laughs to create alternative  doors to the island and the pure portal  which lives there without a doubt sloane  is up to something but we have to wait  to see what her next move will be and  what about those images in her office  sloane knows more than we probably ever  will her next step will likely come  during the end of season event as the  cube queen makes her advances  [Music]  into the top three we go and it's time  for a character who is the bedrock of  the story the foundation when the  foundation arrived on the island it was  immediately obvious he wasn't a newcomer  here he recognized an i o agent  immediately and started to break his  face foundation likes to scrap in his  two appearances so far he's fought agent  jones he's fought the batman who laughs  he's fought lex luthor and he's even  fought the og batman himself he loves a  good scuffle foundation was revealed to  be the leader of the seven a group  responsible for the black hole event in  chapter one which made so many kids cry  their mission statement is to liberate  the zero point and destroy the loop  forever the foundation seems to be one  of the oldest characters in fortnite  history he knows everything about  everything he once told batman about the  dawn of time and the big bang which  formed the zero point and the omniverse  foundation has already made a pivotal  sacrifice to the story by giving up his  life to protect the collapse of the zero  point locking himself in the spire  thankfully that was short-lived and he  was transported to gotham city and by  the end of that story the foundation  gave us lots of information he told us  about self-contained suits like those  used by the seven and how they are able  to stop the effects of the island with a  suit like this the user would not lose  their memories their voice or their  superpowers right now the foundation has  found himself back on the island and  he's already escaped the loop by being  the last survivor in the final circle  he's currently around he's searching for  the imagined order  [Music]  at second spot on the list is agent  jones chapter two had a few questionable  story beats early on but once we met  agent jones the storyline became clear  jones was revealed to be an agent of io  the imagined order watching us and  controlling the loop under the  leadership of dr sloan agent jones would  frequently jump onto the island to fix  research or change something before  returning home again this led to so so  many drone snapshots on the island it  was impossible to finish a game without  seeing a jones clone the importance of  agent jones came to a head during the  latter stages of chapter 2 season 5 when  the zero point he was fighting so hard  to protect was moments away from  disaster feeling helpless agent jones  made a last-ditch attempt to save  reality and brought us that member of  the seven we just talked about the  foundation jones completely betrayed his  superiors he left io to save the zero  point and made another sacrifice moments  later agent jones used his only way to  escape the island the portal device to  cocoon the zero point with a foundation  inside this means agent jones is trapped  in the loop and he must have lost his  memory by now he was last spotted hiding  as a cow  what a fall from grace hopefully the  foundation will find him again and the  next part of the story can begin  [Music]  and here we go my pick for the most  important character in fortnite history  the visitor unlike all the other  characters and skins on this list he  can't be found in any cinematic trailers  his impact is never seen and heck we  never saw him once on the island but  without the visitor the story of  fortnite would not be here back in  chapter one during season four and the  booming popularity fortnite found a  secret unlockable skin was added the  blockbuster over weeks we pieced  together the story of the visitor the  meteor in the sky which started this  whole story had the visitor inside after  breaking three he found his way to the  rocket layer on the mountains and began  an escape plan oh here's something that  most people don't notice the visitor can  actually be seen calibrating the rocket  in this loading screen look there's his  shadow when the rocket was ready and the  day came we were all clueless what the  hell was happening we all presumed it  was a malfunction later it was confirmed  he was attempting to find the zero point  something which the scientists managed  to find a few seasons later so much has  happened since that very first time the  seven arrived and the rocket event  confused us all so many questions remain  unanswered but for certain the story of  fortnite is all down to the day the  visitor came to the island in 2018. so  therefore i believe the most important  character in fortnite history is the  visitor what say you so that's my list  of the top 15 what do you reckon you can  be honest is your order different do you  have different characters on it i'll be  in the comments to see what you think  huge thank you to those who've used my  code to adamaru over the last fortnight  it's very much appreciated thank you  very much i'm adam you're awesome i'll  see you next time
 

